Oblivion is the fifth advanced [[Fight|fighting]] zone and features 24 unique monsters over 107 encounters. The final monster does not have a limit to its difficulty and can be fought indefinitely, with increasing health and rewards. Cards from enemies in this zone can only be obtained if the game is focused on this zone.

